WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.605 --> 00:00:02.507
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Who was Andy Warhol?

2
00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:05.766
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> He was an artist.

3
00:00:07.196 --> 00:00:08.818
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Was he English?

4
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.269
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> No, he wasn’t.

5
00:00:13.478 --> 00:00:15.661
He was American.

6
00:00:16.752 --> 00:00:18.787
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> When was he born?

7
00:00:19.996 --> 00:00:23.388
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> He was born in 1928.

8
00:00:24.715 --> 00:00:27.045
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Were his parents American?

9
00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:30.201
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> No, they weren’t.